Run, Yudo!

264
00:21:59,040 --> 00:21:59,920
Sleeve-swing!

265
00:22:01,640 --> 00:22:04,060
She's using that wheel's weapon again!

266
00:22:12,840 --> 00:22:14,580
There's no escape!

267
00:22:20,560 --> 00:22:24,137
I'm actually shocked you two
didn't fall from my illusions.

268
00:22:24,220 --> 00:22:28,140
After all, you're clearly
living in a dream world.

269
00:22:28,720 --> 00:22:31,700
If you think you could ever be Kaido.

270
00:22:36,860 --> 00:22:37,980
Spider, no!

271
00:22:42,720 --> 00:22:44,080
Thanks for that, Robin.

272
00:22:46,880 --> 00:22:49,080
The entire floor is on fire!

273
00:22:49,420 --> 00:22:51,237
What do you think you're
accomplishing here?

274
00:22:51,320 --> 00:22:53,257
You're going to burn
down the whole castle!

275
00:22:53,340 --> 00:22:55,340
You're worried about our castle?

276
00:22:55,680 --> 00:22:57,100
How sweet of you.

277
00:22:57,620 --> 00:23:01,400
In that case, why don't you
be a good girl and surrender?

278
00:23:01,860 --> 00:23:05,742
Could you keep holding on to me
for a moment, if you'd be so kind?

279
00:23:06,080 --> 00:23:08,220
Seems that weapon is a living thing.

280
00:23:09,400 --> 00:23:11,060
I can work with that.

281
00:23:11,940 --> 00:23:12,980
Cold soul.

282
00:23:30,160 --> 00:23:33,395
I hope you don't mind, but
I don't do well in the heat.

283
00:23:40,220 --> 00:23:42,280
This calls for a soul break.

284
00:23:55,040 --> 00:23:55,900
Ice burn.

285
00:23:57,840 --> 00:24:00,400
You just don't know when to quit, do you?

286
00:24:00,800 --> 00:24:02,340
Give it up, Nico Robin.

287
00:24:04,880 --> 00:24:06,480
It's time to wake up.

288
00:24:06,640 --> 00:24:11,522
Your friend sold you out so that he could
escape, and then he left you here to die.

289
00:24:11,680 --> 00:24:16,504
Blackleg knew you were my target, but he
still called for you when I asked him to.

290
00:24:16,760 --> 00:24:17,840
It's no surprise.

291
00:24:18,420 --> 00:24:22,067
The strongest pirates in the
world all have their eyes on you.

292
00:24:22,200 --> 00:24:25,580
And that's turned you into a
liability to your crewmates.

293
00:24:26,680 --> 00:24:29,220
Blackleg couldn't wait to get rid of you.

294
00:24:29,520 --> 00:24:30,680
Help me, Robin!

295
00:24:31,140 --> 00:24:32,500
Help me, please!

296
00:24:38,160 --> 00:24:41,857
And now he's the laughing
stock of the whole island.

297
00:24:41,940 --> 00:24:43,337
Pathetic worm.

298
00:24:43,420 --> 00:24:45,877
His bounty's rather high.

299
00:24:45,960 --> 00:24:48,137
Second highest in your crew, right?

300
00:24:48,220 --> 00:24:51,297
That doesn't reflect too
well on the rest of you.

301
00:24:51,380 --> 00:24:55,477
Oh, that's Sanji.

302
00:24:55,560 --> 00:24:58,057
He sure is something else.

303
00:24:58,140 --> 00:24:59,477
All right.

304
00:24:59,560 --> 00:25:02,457
Robin, shall I leave this
particular foe to you?

305
00:25:02,540 --> 00:25:03,897
I'm glad you asked.

306
00:25:03,980 --> 00:25:05,197
That sounds lovely.

307
00:25:05,280 --> 00:25:09,437
Good because these
ladies need my attention.

308
00:25:09,520 --> 00:25:11,280
If you'll excuse me.

309
00:25:13,640 --> 00:25:16,017
I have a bone to pick with them.

310
00:25:16,100 --> 00:25:17,817
Did I hurt your feelings?

311
00:25:17,900 --> 00:25:19,117
Not at all.

312
00:25:19,200 --> 00:25:21,680
Sanji is kinder than you think.

313
00:25:24,920 --> 00:25:27,857
You don't need to understand
why he asked for my help

314
00:25:27,940 --> 00:25:30,597
and you don't need to know
how much that means to me.

315
00:25:30,680 --> 00:25:35,277
But you should know when the
new king of the pirates soars,

316
00:25:35,360 --> 00:25:37,280
he'll be one of his wings.

317
00:25:44,200 --> 00:25:47,380
I'll end this, Pigante Blur!

318
00:26:13,020 --> 00:26:14,320
Someone's angry.

319
00:26:14,580 --> 00:26:17,657
That certainly is an impressive
trick you've pulled out.

320
00:26:17,740 --> 00:26:20,080
But it looks exhausting.

321
00:26:20,560 --> 00:26:21,580
No need to worry.

322
00:26:21,840 --> 00:26:24,160
It'll all be over before you know it.

323
00:26:27,120 --> 00:26:28,900
Now, sea serpent!

324
00:26:29,400 --> 00:26:30,500
Snap dragon!

325
00:26:37,700 --> 00:26:39,540
You stay right there.

326
00:26:42,860 --> 00:26:44,060
Too slow!

327
00:26:48,360 --> 00:26:49,190
What?

328
00:26:49,273 --> 00:26:52,436
Did you think I'd just stand
here and let you beat me?

329
00:26:55,100 --> 00:26:58,340
So hitting these arms
hurts your real body, huh?

330
00:26:59,160 --> 00:27:02,740
You've turned yourself into
such a nice big target.

331
00:27:03,440 --> 00:27:04,640
So much to jump.

332
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:07,420
I hardly know where to start.

333
00:27:09,420 --> 00:27:11,140
Light, wouldn't you see?

334
00:27:11,500 --> 00:27:13,120
Those are poison bars.

335
00:27:14,780 --> 00:27:16,340
Maria Knight!

336
00:27:32,380 --> 00:27:35,560
More meat, more meat, hurry!

337
00:27:36,540 --> 00:27:37,917
Better give him what he wants.

338
00:27:38,000 --> 00:27:40,517
He's already eaten all the
provisions on the ship.

339
00:27:40,600 --> 00:27:42,217
Yeah, and have you noticed where we are?

340
00:27:42,300 --> 00:27:44,497
Because I don't think
they have a butcher shop.

341
00:27:44,580 --> 00:27:45,410
Luffy!

342
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:48,830
Luffy!

343
00:27:53,240 --> 00:27:55,593
Mama, how did your crew find Luffy Taro?

344
00:27:55,740 --> 00:27:57,480
He fell into the sea. I know.

345
00:27:57,780 --> 00:28:00,397
We saw him sinking and
picked him up in our sub.

346
00:28:00,480 --> 00:28:02,440
Ufiyu, you really did survive.

347
00:28:02,800 --> 00:28:04,329
So glad you're still here.

348
00:28:04,480 --> 00:28:05,800
What happened to you?

349
00:28:06,020 --> 00:28:07,140
You fall down too?

350
00:28:07,420 --> 00:28:09,560
Yes, or rather we escaped.

351
00:28:10,040 --> 00:28:11,275
Shinobu flew us here.

352
00:28:14,020 --> 00:28:15,980
But I periled titans.

353
00:28:20,280 --> 00:28:23,620
Kiku and Kin'emon, they helped us play.

354
00:28:24,080 --> 00:28:25,077
They protected us.

355
00:28:25,160 --> 00:28:26,600
Master King

356
00:28:28,780 --> 00:28:30,557
You always do this.

357
00:28:30,640 --> 00:28:31,777
Save it for later.

358
00:28:31,860 --> 00:28:33,837
You're the leader of the troops.

359
00:28:33,920 --> 00:28:34,937
Don't cry yet.

360
00:28:35,020 --> 00:28:36,680
We have a battle to win.

361
00:28:38,920 --> 00:28:40,777
We gotta beat Kaido.

362
00:28:40,860 --> 00:28:42,557
No crying until then.

363
00:28:42,640 --> 00:28:43,677
That is enough.

364
00:28:43,760 --> 00:28:46,642
Talking to him like that
is only making it worse.

365
00:28:47,840 --> 00:28:49,457
Show us a backbone.

366
00:28:49,540 --> 00:28:50,370
Be brave.

367
00:28:50,453 --> 00:28:52,280
You're gonna be Shogun someday.

368
00:29:06,860 --> 00:29:09,500
I can't move! I'm hungry!

369
00:29:09,740 --> 00:29:10,799
Give me some meat!

370
00:29:10,920 --> 00:29:13,217
Let's all stop yelling
and look for some more!

371
00:29:13,300 --> 00:29:14,320
Hurry! Hurry!

372
00:29:18,200 --> 00:29:19,317
Huh? Huh?

373
00:29:19,400 --> 00:29:21,080
Is that Straw Hat?

374
00:29:21,420 --> 00:29:23,420
Looks like he's at death's door!

375
00:29:23,700 --> 00:29:24,660
This is bad.

376
00:29:25,160 --> 00:29:27,857
Really bad what's going to happen to me if

377
00:29:27,940 --> 00:29:30,777
he dies i didn't account
for this in my plan!

378
00:29:30,860 --> 00:29:32,917
I'm gonna be stuck in
this hell whole country

379
00:29:33,000 --> 00:29:35,797
without a friend in sight
i need him to survive!

380
00:29:35,880 --> 00:29:41,657
This hey

381
00:29:41,740 --> 00:29:44,877
mama i'm gonna

382
00:29:44,960 --> 00:29:45,877
need you to take me

383
00:29:45,960 --> 00:29:51,620
back to Onigashima turn
into a dragon fly me up

384
00:29:55,940 --> 00:29:57,397
Take me to Kaido.

385
00:29:57,480 --> 00:29:58,980
I'll do the rest.
